{"number": 99, "event_name": "GPT Academic文件上传接口路径未校验导致认证用户任意文件读取与API密钥泄露漏洞", "class_report_1": "系统安全风险", "class_report_2": "任意文件读取", "products_components_services": "GPT Academic", "operating_entity": "binary-husky", "risk_description": "在面向大语言模型的交互式Web应用GPT Academic中发现一处认证用户任意文件读取漏洞，该平台支持论文阅读、润色、写作、代码解析及PDF翻译等学术功能，主要面向学术研究者和开发者。该漏洞存在于`/gpt/run/predict`文件上传接口中，系统未对文件参数中的路径进行校验与过滤，攻击者以普通用户身份登录后，可将任意本地文件路径作为文件参数提交，系统会将目标文件复制至用户私有上传目录，攻击者随后通过`/gpt/file=private_upload/...`路径即可下载该文件。该漏洞无需管理员权限即可利用，攻击者可借此读取`/etc/passwd`等系统文件及包含API密钥的配置文件，导致敏感凭据泄露，对所有部署GPT Academic的用户环境构成严重安全威胁。", "source_url": "https://github.com/binary-husky/gpt_academic", "source_website": "", "paper_title": "", "research_team": "", "is_verify": "", "is_submit": "", "submission_channel": "邮箱", "submission_time": "2026-05-20 00:00:00", "content": "# binary-husky/gpt_academic\n\nGPT Academic is an open-source project for academic optimization with GPT. It provides a rich set of features for paper reading, translation, code explanation, and more.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- ⭐ Access new models: Support for Qwen, GLM, DeepseekCoder and more\n- ⭐ Mermaid image rendering: Support for flowcharts, state diagrams, Gantt charts, etc.\n- ⭐ Arxiv paper fine translation: High-quality translation for arxiv papers\n- ⭐ Real-time voice dialogue input: Asynchronous audio listening and automatic sentence breaking\n- Polish, translate, code explanation: One-click polish, translate, find paper syntax errors, explain code\n- Custom shortcuts: Support for custom keyboard shortcuts\n- Modular design: Support for custom powerful plugins with hot updates\n- Program analysis: One-click analysis of Python/C/C++/Java/Lua projects\n- Read and translate papers: One-click interpretation of full latex/pdf papers and summary generation\n\nThis project has 70.7k+ stars on GitHub and is widely used for academic research and writing assistance.", "submit_user_name": "长亭"}
